note.p:
(a) When the European defense community had been
                    established it wld be necessary to consider its position in relation to the
                    treaty and, in particular, to Art 6 thereof;

(b) Article II (1) of the protocol covered the Greek
                    and Turkish Islands in the Mediterranean and Malta and its dependencies, but not
                    Cyprus;

(c) The protocol did not affect the interpretation
                    placed on the words ‘Nortn Atlantic area’ in the preamble and in Articles 5 and
                    12 of the treaty;
